<title>POLAND: Polish shares fall in Warsaw continuous trade.</title>
<headline>Polish shares fall in Warsaw continuous trade.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in BIG, Budimex and Stalexport fell and Universal rose in Warsaw bourse continuous trade on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Three companies were flat and the remaining three did not trade. Total turnover amounted to two million zlotys.</p>
<p>NFI units fell 3.1 percent to 141.5 zlotys in a 16.5-million zloty turnover.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
